#, xml-text
msgid "Introduction to Xorg Wacom Driver"
msgstr "Introdução ao Controlador Wacom do Xorg"

#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/x7driver-wacom.xml:34
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The <application>Xorg Wacom Driver</application> package contains the X.Org "
"X11 driver and SDK for Wacom and Wacom-like tablets. It is not required to "
"use a Wacom tablet, the <application>xf86-input-evdev</application> driver "
"can handle these devices without problems."
msgstr ""
"O pacote <application>Controlador &quot;Wacom&quot; do "
"&quot;Xorg&quot;</application> contém o controlador &quot;X11&quot; do "
"&quot;X.Org&quot; e &quot;SDK&quot; para &quot;Wacom&quot; e "
"&quot;tablets&quot; semelhantes a &quot;Wacom&quot;. Não é exigido usar um "
"&quot;tablet&quot; &quot;Wacom&quot;; o controlador "
"&quot;<application>xf86-input-evdev</application>&quot; consegue lidar com "
"esses dispositivos sem problemas."

