#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/x7driver-wacom.xml:96
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"To use a Wacom tablet with USB interface, enable the following options in "
"your kernel configuration and recompile. Note that other configuration "
"options could be required for tablet with a serial or bluetooth interface:"
msgstr ""
"Para usar um &quot;tablet&quot; &quot;Wacom&quot; com interface "
"&quot;USB&quot;, habilite as seguintes opções na tua configuração do núcleo "
"e recompile. Observe que outras opções de configuração podem ser exigidas "
"para &quot;tablets&quot; com uma interface serial ou &quot;bluetooth&quot;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><title>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/x7driver-wacom.xml:111
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of Xorg Wacom Driver"
msgstr "Instalação do Controlador Wacom do Xorg"

#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/x7driver-wacom.xml:114
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Install <application>Xorg Wacom Driver</application> by running the "
"following commands:"
msgstr ""
"Instale o <application>Controlador &quot;Wacom&quot; do "
"&quot;Xorg&quot;</application> executando os seguintes comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/x7driver-wacom.xml:118
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>./configure $XORG_CONFIG --with-systemd-unit-dir=no &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>./configure $XORG_CONFIG --with-systemd-unit-dir=no &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/x7driver-wacom.xml:121
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>./configure $XORG_CONFIG &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>./configure $XORG_CONFIG &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/x7driver-wacom.xml:125
#, xml-text
msgid "To test the results, issue: <command>make check</command>."
msgstr "Para testar os resultados, emita: <command>make check</command>."

#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/x7driver-wacom.xml:129
#, xml-text
msgid "Now, as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Agora, como o(a) usuário(a) &quot;<systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>&quot;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/x7driver-wacom.xml:132
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>make install</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>make install</userinput>"

